 Requirements:
 -------------
 This install requires WHDLoad and DIC to be in the path.
 These programs can be found in the WHDLoad package.
 To install from a different drive than DF0: select installation mode Expert.

 The installed game requires 0.5 MB ChipMem (+600k other mem for preload option). 
 It can be quit by pressing Del (key can be changed with Tooltype "QuitKey=").


 Features:
 ---------
 - Full load from HD
 - 7 versions supported
 - Load/Save from data disk supported
 - Protection removed (12xchecksums, 4xdisk checks, 1x "Cobra X-Rom" encryption)
 - Invalid copperlist entries fixed (x2)
 - Empty dbf loop in keyboard routine fixed
 - Automatic creation of data disk (see below)
 - NewIcon, RomIcon and OS3.5+ color icon (all created by Irek'72)
 - Quit option that works on 68000 machines (default key is 'Del')

 Finally got around to creating the install package for this
 one too. Did the slave way back in March 2009 and somehow
 didn't manage to create the install package. This is now
 fixed. :)
 Not much to say about this one, except for the usual
 encrypted binary and lots of checksums there wasn't anything
 special. Enjoy this classic from HD, I'm sure a few of
 you will. ;)
 
 If you already have a data disk create an image of it using
 tools like DIC (can be found in the WHDLoad package), rename
 the image to "disk.2" and copy it to the installation directory.

 If no data disk is found it will be created, this feature
 can be disabled with the CUSTOM1=1 tooltype.

 Player Manager 2 (ECS) will be available soon too, it'll probably
 the first install package I'll create in 2010. :)

 Have fun with this game from HD now.
 Sting, 25-Aug-2014

